  "slug": "guest-incident-inventory-log-form",
  "title": "Guest Incident Inventory Log Form",
  "subtitle": "Track what the incident produced: retained items with chain of custody, guest property held, supplies used, and damaged venue property.",
  "description": "An original property and supplies log for a guest incident case. It records the log identity and custody owner, retained items with an unbroken chain of custody, guest property held or taken for repair, first-aid and cleanup supplies consumed, damaged venue property with its work order, release and disposal decisions, and an accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use when an incident leaves physical items to account for: a retained mat, a guest's damaged property, supplies drawn from a kit, or venue equipment taken out of service. The log closes when every item is released, returned, or disposed of with an authorizing name.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
