        {
          "key": "custody_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "What this log does not decide",
          "guidance": "This log records custody, condition, and movement. It does not value a guest's property, accept liability for damage or loss, authorize a replacement, or decide whether an item may be destroyed. Route valuation, replacement, and disposal decisions to the responsible manager and the insurer under applicable policy, and keep every item while a case or claim is open."
        }
